<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V AUSTRALIA SECOND TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V AUSTRALIA SECOND TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
